---
name: coverage-report-mac
version: 1.0.0
description: macOS coverage report markdown rendered from the canonical coverage JSON.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - report.status
  - report.coverage_level
  - report.timestamp_display
  - report.commit
  - report.duration_secs
  - report.collector
  - report.summary
  - report.crates
  - report.notes
# report.summary is null on a placeholder report; the template reads these
# only inside the report.summary branch, so the defaults are never rendered.
defaults:
  report.summary.line_percent: ""
  report.summary.line_covered: ""
  report.summary.line_count: ""
  report.summary.function_percent: ""
  report.summary.function_covered: ""
  report.summary.function_count: ""
---
# Coverage Report: mac

- status: `{{ report.status }}`
- coverage level: `{{ report.coverage_level }}`
- timestamp: `{{ report.timestamp_display }}`
- commit: `{{ report.commit }}`
- duration: `{{ report.duration_secs }}` seconds
- collector: `{{ report.collector }}`

{% if report.summary %}
## Summary

- line coverage: `{{ report.summary.line_percent }}%` (`{{ report.summary.line_covered }}` / `{{ report.summary.line_count }}`)
- function coverage: `{{ report.summary.function_percent }}%` (`{{ report.summary.function_covered }}` / `{{ report.summary.function_count }}`)

## Per-Crate Coverage

| Crate | Line % | Function % |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
{% for crate in report.crates -%}
| `{{ crate.name }}` | `{{ crate.line_percent }}%` | `{{ crate.function_percent }}%` |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
## Summary

No macOS coverage run has been recorded on this branch yet.
{% endif %}

## Notes

{% for note in report.notes -%}
- {{ note }}
{% endfor %}
